title: "Kidney Disease Radiology AI Workstation: Deep Learning CT Scan Classifier"
abstract: "A high-precision medical AI workstation for automated kidney disease classification from CT scans (Tumor, Cyst, Stone, and Normal Tissue) using transfer learning with VGG16, reaching 93.47% accuracy."
